            "content_html": "<h2 class=\"text-[32px] md:text-[48px] font-bold text-brand-light leading-[1]\">News</h2>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] font-normal text-brand-light/80\">Stay informed about the Visegrad Fund. News provide updates on recent developments, key activities, upcoming initiatives, and official announcements, including the open calls.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Slovakia holds the presidency of the V4 group </h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-3\">As of 1 July 2026, Slovakia holds the Presidency of the Visegrad Group (V4), a regional alliance of Czechia, Hungary, Po…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Project of the Year 2025 - Sounds of Diversity</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-3\">As part of the International Visegrad Fund's 26th Anniversary Evening, the Project of the Year 2025 award was presented…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Four books receive the first Visegrad Literary Award</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-3\">The International Visegrad Fund has presented the Visegrad Literary Award for the first time, recognising four outstandi…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Visegrad Fund Publishes 2025 Annual Report</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">The International Visegrad Fund has released its 2025 Annual Report, marking a special year in which the Fund celebrated the 25th anniversary of its e…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Make your research at the Blinken OSA Archivum </h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">The Scholarship Program implemented in collaboration with a dynamic archival institution offers research at the Open Society Archives (OSA) at the Cen…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">The first results of V4 GEN Mini Grants 2026 are out</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">We are pleased to inform you that the first call results of this year are approved and available on our website. You can find it here.Our project mana…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Vote for the Project of the Year 2025</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">We are excited to announce the launch of the Visegrad Fund Project of the Year 2025 public voting campaign!To celebrate the power of great ideas and t…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">The Second Call for Visegrad Grants is Open</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">The Second Call for Visegrad Grants is Open from 1May until 1 JuneVisegrad grants support regional partnerships among civil society organizations, pub…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">The Results of this Year's First open call are now in!</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">We are pleased to announce the results of this year’s first open call and to inform you that 62 projects will receive funding under the Visegrad/Viseg…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Info Week will take place in April</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">Interested in getting funding for your project, scholarship, fellowship or artistic residency? The spring edition of Info Week is coming in April! Ser…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">The Visegrad fund has awarded the \"Mini project of the year\" award for the first time</h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">The very first Mini Project of the Year award ceremony took place at the premises of the Visegrad Fund in Bratislava. Students and teachers of the Voc…</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-[20px] md:text-[24px] leading-[127%] font-bold text-brand-darker group-hover:text-brand-brand transition-colors\">Call for Western Balkans–Visegrad Fellowships </h3>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] text-brand-dark line-clamp-2 sm:line-clamp-3\">The Western Balkans–Visegrad Fellowship Program is back with its third edition! A total of 85 scholarship recipients have participated in this program…</p>",
