            "title": "Inspirational Projects Read about past projects we have done. READ STORIES",
            "summary": "<h2 class=\"text-[32px] md:text-[48px] font-bold text-brand-light leading-[1]\">Inspirational projects</h2>\n<p class=\"text-[14px] md:text-[16px] leading-[140%] font-normal text-brand-light/80\">Find out more about funding projects that can inspire what Visegrad cooperation can mean and how it contributes to the benefit of citizens across the region.</p>\n<ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"flex\" slot=\"item\"><a href=\"/explore/inspirational-projects/youth-fashion-values-dialogue-within-v4\" class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-brand-light transition hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/2] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430097_002.jpg\" srcset=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430097_002.jpg 480w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430097_002.jpg 768w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430097_002.jpg 1024w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430097_002.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\" alt=\"12430097_002\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-5 p-5 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-brand-dark\"><h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold leading-snug\">Youth Fashion – Values &amp; Dialogue in the V4</h3><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug line-clamp-2\">High school students from Poland and Czechia explored together creativity, craftsmanship, and cultural heritage through hands-on fashion and design activities. </p></div><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark bg-transparent px-3 py-0 text-[14px] sm:text-[16px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-150 group-hover:bg-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-light\">Read more<svg width=\"15\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 10\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"shrink-0\"><path d=\"M9.66634 0.833496L13.833 5.00016M13.833 5.00016L9.66634 9.16683M13.833 5.00016H1.16634\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></li><li class=\"flex\" slot=\"item\"><a href=\"/explore/inspirational-projects/believe-it-or-not\" class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-brand-light transition hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/2] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/v4-hradek-2024-4.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/v4-hradek-2024-4.jpeg 480w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/v4-hradek-2024-4.jpeg 768w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/v4-hradek-2024-4.jpeg 1024w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/v4-hradek-2024-4.jpeg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\" alt=\"v4-hradek-2024-4\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-5 p-5 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-brand-dark\"><h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold leading-snug\">Believe it or not</h3><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug line-clamp-2\">The town of Hrádek in the Moravian-Silesian region hosted a unique encounter of&nbsp;high school students from Poland and the Czech Republic.&nbsp;The project’s main theme was media literacy and fake news, tackled through non-formal education.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></div><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark bg-transparent px-3 py-0 text-[14px] sm:text-[16px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-150 group-hover:bg-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-light\">Read more<svg width=\"15\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 10\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"shrink-0\"><path d=\"M9.66634 0.833496L13.833 5.00016M13.833 5.00016L9.66634 9.16683M13.833 5.00016H1.16634\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></li><li class=\"flex\" slot=\"item\"><a href=\"/explore/inspirational-projects/the-wbb-orchestra\" class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-brand-light transition hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/2] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/n88a4968.jpg\" srcset=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/n88a4968.jpg 480w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/n88a4968.jpg 768w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/n88a4968.jpg 1024w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/n88a4968.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\" alt=\"n88a4968\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-5 p-5 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-brand-dark\"><h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold leading-snug\">The WBB Orchestra</h3><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug line-clamp-2\">The WBB Orchestra (Wrocław, Bydgoszcz, Brno) brought together young students from three prestigious music academies in Poland and the Czech Republic and revived Baroque works through a series of concerts.</p></div><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark bg-transparent px-3 py-0 text-[14px] sm:text-[16px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-150 group-hover:bg-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-light\">Read more<svg width=\"15\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 10\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"shrink-0\"><path d=\"M9.66634 0.833496L13.833 5.00016M13.833 5.00016L9.66634 9.16683M13.833 5.00016H1.16634\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></li><li class=\"flex\" slot=\"item\"><a href=\"/explore/inspirational-projects/solar-energy-teens\" class=\"group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-brand-light transition hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/2] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430153_014.jpg\" srcset=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/viseg