light transition hover:shadow-lg\"><div class=\"aspect-[3/2] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" src=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430003_003.jpg\" srcset=\"https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430003_003.jpg 480w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430003_003.jpg 768w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430003_003.jpg 1024w, https://s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads.mangoweb.org/shared-prod/visegradfund.org/uploads/2025/10/12430003_003.jpg 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw\" alt=\"12430003_003\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-5 p-5 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"space-y-2 sm:space-y-3 text-brand-dark\"><h3 class=\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold leading-snug\">The protection of biocenoses – our future</h3><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base leading-snug line-clamp-2\">This project carries a remarkable legacy – cooperation between vocational schools, which over the years has developed into a lively educational experience. Even the COVID-19 pandemic was unable to interrupt this valuable tradition for more than two years.</p></div><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark bg-transparent px-3 py-0 text-[14px] sm:text-[16px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-150 group-hover:bg-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-light\">Read more<svg width=\"15\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 10\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"shrink-0\"><path d=\"M9.66634 0.83