ustoms on the outdoor staging of Kupala Night in Muszyna.</p></div><div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-dark bg-transparent px-3 py-0 text-[14px] sm:text-[16px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-dark transition-colors duration-150 group-hover:bg-brand-dark group-hover:text-brand-light\">Read more<svg width=\"15\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 15 10\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"shrink-0\"><path d=\"M9.66634 0.833496L13.833 5.00016M13.833 5.00016L9.66634 9.16683M13.833 5.00016H1.16634\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div></div></a></li></ul>",
