            "id": "e02780c10dd40c7319d2b6594bbf4865dc271ca9764adaec2b16b5142585222c",
            "content_html": "<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold \"><strong>Governing, executing and administrating</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed \">The governing bodies of the International Visegrad Fund are the Conference of Ministers  of Foreign Affairs (it consists of the V4 foreign ministers) and the Council of Ambassadors (is composed of ambassadors of V4 countries accredited in the country holding the V4 presidency in a given year). </p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed \">The executive body of the International Visegrad Fund consists of the Executive Director, supported by the Deputy Executive Director. The Visegrad Fund’s management is renewed through a regular three-year rotation of these positions, with representatives from all four Visegrad countries taking turns in the roles.</p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed \">The administrative body of the Visegrad Fund is the Secretariat, composed of staff members from all four Visegrad countries.</p>",
            "url": "https://www.visegradfund.org/about-us/secretariat",
            "title": "Get in Touch Find the right person to contact – see our team contacts. CONTACT US",
            "summary": "<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold \"><strong>Governing, executing and administrating</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed \">The governing bodies of the International Visegrad Fund are the Conference of Ministers  of Foreign Affairs (it consists of the V4 foreign ministers) and the Council of Ambassadors (is composed of ambassadors of V4 countries accredited in the country holding the V4 presidency in a given year). </p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed \">The executive body of the International Visegrad Fund consists of the Executive Director, supported by the Deputy Executive Director. The Visegrad Fund’s management is renewed through a regular three-year rotation of these positions, with representatives from all four Visegrad countries taking turns in the roles.</p>\n<p class=\"leading-relaxed \">The administrative body of the Visegrad Fund is the Secretariat, composed of staff members from all four Visegrad countries.</p>",
